- `crates/vox-workflow-runtime/src/file_journal.rs`:
    - Introduced `PeriodicFlusher` struct and its `spawn` method to manage a background thread for periodic journal syncing, used for `JournalFlushStrategy::Periodic` (desktop profile).
    - Implemented `Suspendable` for `FileJournalTracker` to flush the journal on suspend.
    - Implemented `Resumable` for `FileJournalTracker` to resume operations.
