    - Added `FileJournal::open_with_durability` to allow specifying `AppendDurability`.
    - Moved `FileJournal::sync` method from a bounded `impl` to an unbounded `impl` to allow flushing regardless of entry type.
    - Added `durability` field to `FileJournal` struct.
- `crates/vox-journal/src/lib.rs`:
    - Exported `AppendDurability` enum.
    - Updated crate-level documentation to reflect the new `AppendDurability` options and their use in mobile profiles.
- `docs/src/architecture/where-things-live.md`:
    - Updated description for `vox-journal` to mention deferred-to-lifecycle sync for mobile profiles.

